{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11000","headline":"刘九法曹郑瑕丘石门宴集 · 杜甫","name":"刘九法曹郑瑕丘石门宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋水清无底，萧然静客心。\n掾曹乘逸兴，鞍马去相寻。\n能吏逢聊璧，华筵直一金。\n晚来横吹好，泓下亦龙吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}